      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Six gift pages, zero products"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Gifts for Him, Her, Under $50 / $75 / $100 and for All are published with 0 products, while 429 in-stock listings still carry the SM: Gifts tag."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "One season, two spellings"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "2,300 listings carry a fall-layers tag: 1,260 as “SM: Fall-layers” and 1,040 as “sm: fall-layers”, with no overlap, under a homepage that leads with Fall Layers."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Used gear, marked new"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Product JSON-LD on 23 of 23 sampled product pages declares NewCondition on items sold as Like New, Slightly Worn and Broken In."
    },
